# packages/internal-cli environment variables
#
# See /docs/SECRETS.md at the repo root for the full cross-service
# convention. This tool is never deployed anywhere (Vercel/Railway) — it
# only ever runs from a Volar team member's own machine, so these values
# live in a local, gitignored .env file only. Copy this file to .env and
# fill it in with the real project's values (Supabase Dashboard > Project
# Settings > API).

# --- Supabase (issue 4.5 — internal PriceTable CLI) ---
# Service role key: bypasses Row-Level Security. Required because
# price_table (issue 4.1) grants no INSERT policy to `authenticated` —
# only elevated/internal tooling can add a new price version.
# NEVER commit this value, paste it in a PR/Slack message, or use it in
# any customer-facing app (that's what NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is
# for, in apps/dashboard).
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
